                <span begin="04:47.762" end="04:48.503">っ</span>
                <span begin="04:48.503" end="04:50.252">て</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你对我说 回去吧</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="04:53.279" end="04:57.856" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">
                <span begin="04:53.279" end="04:55.910">帰</span>
                <span begin="04:55.910" end="04:56.650">る</span>
                <span begin="04:56.650" end="04:57.856">わ</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们便回去罢</span>
            </p>
        </div>
    </body>
</tt>
